Preserve this bounded milestone separately from the jitless checkpoint:

    python3 tools/sparc64/checkpoint.py --profile sparkplug

This records the current source overlay, node/d8/addon, configuration,
shared-library dependencies and the final Sparkplug evidence. Its manifest
